{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多后书","commonName":"哥林多后书","title":"哥林多后书","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"72b1061cc86dce53418169bc52aa5129601cef464e3676ce67f900ee20efdee1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["新约的执事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我们岂是又举荐自己吗？岂像别人用人的荐信给你们或用你们的荐信给人吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们就是我们的荐信，写在我们的心里，被众人所知道所念诵的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你们明显是基督的信，借着我们修成的。不是用墨写的，乃是用永生 神的灵写的；不是写在石版上，乃是写在心版上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们因基督，所以在 神面前才有这样的信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["并不是我们凭自己能承担什么事；我们所能承担的，乃是出于 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他叫我们能承当这新约的执事，不是凭着字句，乃是凭着精意；因为那字句是叫人死，精意",{"noteId":2},"是叫人活。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那用字刻在石头上属死的职事尚且有荣光，甚至以色列人因摩西面上的荣光，不能定睛看他的脸；这荣光原是渐渐退去的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["何况那属灵的职事岂不更有荣光吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["若是定罪的职事有荣光，那称义的职事荣光就越发大了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那从前有荣光的，因这极大的荣光就算不得有荣光了；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["若那废掉的有荣光，这长存的就更有荣光了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们既有这样的盼望，就大胆讲说，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["不像摩西将帕子蒙在脸上，叫以色列人不能定睛看到那将废者的结局。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但他们的心地刚硬，直到今日诵读旧约的时候，这帕子还没有揭去。这帕子在基督里已经废去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["然而直到今日，每逢诵读摩西书的时候，帕子还在他们心上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["但他们的心几时归向主，帕子就几时除去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["主就是那灵；主的灵在哪里，那里就得以自由。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["我们众人既然敞着脸得以看见主的荣光，好像从镜子里返照，就变成主的形状，荣上加荣，如同从主的灵变成的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：圣灵","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CO/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}